pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Companion, NOT run by the gate: the same checker and `plain.opb`, with a
% logged model. It answers `s VERIFIED SATISFIABLE`, exit 0. One checker, one
% formula, both verdicts -- so no external solver is needed to see that
% `plain.pbp`'s verdict is false.
f 1 ;
sol x1 x2 ;
output NONE;
conclusion SAT ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
